		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Computational Geometry Software Developer Position]]></title>

		
		<content type="html" xml:base="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/viewtopic.php?p=37716#p37716"><![CDATA[
An exciting and growing company is seeking an intermediate to senior level computational geometry software engineer with experience in developing computational geometry, contact detection, and meshing algorithms.<br><br>The individual will work with a team responsible for developing a software framework to build and maintain finite element, soft body, and rigid body simulation models.<br><br><strong class="text-strong">Necessary Skills and Experience:</strong><br>Strong background in C++ programming and mathematics (linear algebra and partial differential equations)<br>Strong background in developing computational geometry algorithms from scratch<br>Experience with developing meshing algorithms<br>Experience with developing contact detection algorithms<br>Experience with the Finite Element Method (FEM) is a plus<br>Experience with High Performance Computing (MPI, OpenMP)<br>Excellent technical writing and verbal skills (English)<br><br><strong class="text-strong">Position Responsibilities:</strong><br>Design and develop computational geometry algorithms for a simulation engine<br>Design and develop contact detection algorithms for a simulation engine<br>Design and develop meshing algorithms for a simulation engine<br>Communicate, track, and report progress<br>Interact with other engineers to provide design feedback<br><br><strong class="text-strong">Required Qualifications:</strong><br>Master’s Degree in Computer Science/ Mathematics/Mechanical Engineering or equivalent experience<br>Minimum 2 years of work experience in software development<br>Relocation to the Phoenix, AZ area is necessary<br><br><strong class="text-strong">General: </strong><br>EndoVantage (<a href="http://endovantage.com/" class="postlink">http://endovantage.com/</a>) is a simulation software company based in Scottsdale, AZ. The company's goal is to build novel simulation software platforms that transform industries.<br><br>The company is managed by a well-seasoned management team with experience in building successful startups. The management team consists of businessmen, scientists, and engineers with strong relationships with many research institutions and large companies.<br><br>Please apply to our Indeed posting: <a href="http://www.indeed.com/cmp/EndoVantage/jobs/Computational-Geometry-Software-Developer-e6cbae1176bacd6e?sjdu=QwrRXKrqZ3CNX5W-O9jEvbRz-uVhdRmxj5A43S_c6t9wyjqS9jgSBRFJdKSCE4zoBeG6So7HJzJ8zxYxsFE_KSN-mB4AMWiBiChH7KirnkTVgD9D7lhziINy2yHtEjCk" class="postlink">http://www.indeed.com/cmp/EndoVantage/j ... Ny2yHtEjCk</a><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="https://pybullet.org/Bullet/phpBB3/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=11590">EndoVantage</a> — Tue Jun 14, 2016 5:51 pm</p><hr />
